{"organizations": [], "uuid": "626359bceb81dee12337805e2c1f60601b4cb69d", "thread": {"social": {"gplus": {"shares": 0}, "pinterest": {"shares": 0}, "vk": {"shares": 0}, "linkedin": {"shares": 0}, "facebook": {"likes": 0, "shares": 0, "comments": 0}, "stumbledupon": {"shares": 0}}, "site_full": "www.sunmag.net", "main_image": "http://static6.businessinsider.com/image/5b4d1df750d5fd1b008b4ad7/apple-swapped-all-of-its-executives-official-headshots-for-emoji-on-its-website.jpg", "site_section": "http://www.sunmag.net/category/news", "section_title": "Category : News", "url": "http://www.sunmag.net/apple-swapped-all-of-its-executives-official-headshots-for-emoji-on-its-website-aapl", "country": "BG", "title": "Apple swapped all of its executives' official headshots for emoji on its website (AAPL)", "performance_score": 0, "site": "sunmag.net", "participants_count": 1, "title_full": "", "spam_score": 0.002, "site_type": "news", "published": "2018-07-16T19:21:00.000+03:00", "replies_count": 0, "uuid": "626359bceb81dee12337805e2c1f60601b4cb69d"}, "author": "sunmag.net", "url": "http://www.sunmag.net/apple-swapped-all-of-its-executives-official-headshots-for-emoji-on-its-website-aapl", "ord_in_thread": 0, "title": "Apple swapped all of its executives' official headshots for emoji on its website (AAPL)", "locations": [], "entities": {"persons": [{"name": "tim cook", "sentiment": "none"}], "locations": [], "organizations": [{"name": "apple", "sentiment": "none"}]}, "highlightText": "", "language": "english", "persons": [], "text": "Emoji were swapped in for the headshots of Apple executives, including Tim Cook, on the company's website Monday. The profile updates coincide with a published company blog post & offering a glimpse at Apple's new round of emoji, as well as to celebrate the unofficial World Emoji Day holiday. The new emoji will be available for iPhone users in a September software update. Visitors to Apple's page for its executive leadership team on Monday were surprised to find that the official headshots were replaced with emoji-fied portraits.&\nThe emoji faces, superimposed on top of the execs' real-life torsos, are a tongue-in-cheek way for the the company to commemorate the reveal of the next round of emoji, which the company announced on Monday will launch in a free September sofware update for iPhone and iPad.&\nApple gave a glimpse of some of the 70 new emoji in a blog post published Monday, including more hair options for human faces, a cupcake, and a kangaroo.&\nThe change also seems to be an early celebration for World Emoji Day, an unofficial holiday to celebrate the ubiqitous emoticons, which is on Tuesday.&\nSEE ALSO:& Here's our first look at some of the new emoji coming to iPhones later this year\nJoin the conversation about this story »\nNOW WATCH: What people get wrong about superfoods", "external_links": ["http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=L5QR5fYOlOY:vYUI2_9e09c:cGdyc7Q-1BI", "http://static3.businessinsider.com/image/5b4d1eb54474db2a008b4849-1492/screen", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?d=bcOpcFrp8Mo", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=L5QR5fYOlOY:vYUI2_9e09c:yIl2AUoC8zA", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?i=L5QR5fYOlOY:vYUI2_9e09c:V_sGLiPBpWU", "https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2018/07/apple-celebrates-world-emoji-day/", "https://www.apple.com/leadership/", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=L5QR5fYOlOY:vYUI2_9e09c:V_sGLiPBpWU", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=L5QR5fYOlOY:vYUI2_9e09c:qj6IDK7rITs", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?a=L5QR5fYOlOY:vYUI2_9e09c:7Q72WNTAKBA", "http://feeds.feedburner.com/~ff/typepad/alleyinsider/silicon_alley_insider?i=L5QR5fYOlOY:vYUI2_9e09c:gIN9vFwOqvQ", "http://feeds.feedburner.